    <string name="party1_help_new_tools">Players: the list at the top is shared. Edit it once and Score Keeper, Team Splitter, Who Pays, Turn Order, Who Starts, Game Clock, Rounds and Card Dealer all use it.\n\nScore Keeper: tap +1, +5, +10 or -1 for a player, or Other for any amount. Next round starts a new row in the history, Undo removes the last entry, and Reset asks first. It is saved on this device.\n\nTeam Splitter: pick 2 to 4 teams and tap Split. Re-roll shuffles again, Copy puts the teams on the clipboard.\n\nWho Pays: tap Pick to choose one name at random.</string>

